 (jointly set by the paired-test power calc; proposals\n  Gâ‰ˆ10pp, kâ‰ˆ10 real-history fixtures, to be confirmed-or-raised); min calibration **ICCâ‰¥0.7**.\n\n---\n\n## Wave 1 â€” Schema + canary harness foundation + frozen constants (GATE-0)\n**Serves:** all (the harness + constants everything is gated by). **Increment 1.**\n**Done-when:** the committed typed output schema + `prereg-constants.json` (R, firing-threshold, caps) exist;\nthe canary harness supports per-finding field-level + rung-gated assertions, proven by a harness meta-test;\n`node --test test/*.test.mjs` exits 0.\n- **Given** a finding carrying a rung + a rung-gated field, **When** the harness asserts a rung ceiling,\n  **Then** a violating fixture FAILS and a conformant fixture passes.\n- **Given** an empty schema-conformant advisor output, **When** the suite runs, **Then** it passes (shape,\n  reasoning-before-verdict, nitpick/elevation caps).\n\n## Wave 2 â€” Diagnose seam (compose the vetted core)\n**Serves:** NS1. **Increment 1.**\n**Done-when:** the vetted diagnose core (PROTOCOL v2) is the SOLE diagnosis source; B5 passes and its\ndiscriminating negative FAILS; `node --test` green.\n- **Given** a diagnose finding without `gandalf_core` provenance (or re-derived inline), **When** B5 runs,\n  **Then** it FAILS.\n\n## Wave 3 â€” SITUATE compose (abstract â†’ commission â†’ structure-map â†’ outside-view)\n**Serves:** NS2. **Increment 1.**\n**Done-when:** S0-abstract â†’ firing gate â†’ commission researchPrime (bare `agent()` seam) â†’ structure-map\n(â‰¥2 relational correspondences, answer-first) â†’ outside-view base rate; B-ceiling passes and its negative\nFAILS; same-family commission gets no independent-origin credit; `node --test` green.\n- **Given** a `cross_model:false` run, **When** an elevation is stamped GROUNDED, **Then** B-ceiling FAILS\n  (max achievable tier is PROMISING).\n- **Given** a SITUATE finding whose facts are unverified, **When** scored, **Then** it is capped (no\n  self-CORROBORATED; unverifiable â†’ needs_verification handoff).\n\n## Wave 4 â€” Refutation discipline (the NS4 honesty spine)\n**Serves:** NS4. **Increment 1.**\n**Done-when:** the INDEPENDENT named-defeater refuter for each high-value elevation; B-honesty passes and its\nnegative FAILS; the bounded-refuter budget path is a NAMED canary; `node --test` green.\n- **Given** an elevation whose `what_would_refute_it` is a self-rated confidence word (no named concrete\n  defeater + `refutation_provenance`), **When** B-honesty runs, **Then** it FAILS / auto-downgrades.\n- **Given** independent refuters requested beyond budget R (=3, from `prereg-constants.json`), **When** the cap\n  is hit, **Then** a canary asserts the run HALTs (no silent drop); findings below the firing threshold ship\n  SPECULATIVE with the \"no independent refutation ran\" stamp.\n\n## Wave 5 â€” ANTICIPATE (Oranges-lens bounded premortem)\n**Serves:** NS3. **Increment 1.**\n**Done-when:** a bounded premortem (subject_cardinality==1; each anticipation = a populated, well-formed\n`future_state_condition` + `enabling_assumption`); B3 + B9 pass and their negatives FAIL; the advisory\ncross-path-cost flag is wired ISOLATED (never in the gate); `node --test` green.\n- **Given** an anticipate finding with a regret/counterfactual-cost field OR subject_cardinality>1, **When** B3\n  runs, **Then** it FAILS (Crucible's Oranges engine â†’ route to a Crucible commission).\n- **Given** a present-tense anticipate finding (no populated future-state + enabling assumption), **When** B9\n  runs, **Then** it FAILS.\n\n## Wave 6 â€” SCORE / LABEL / SYNTHESIS\n**Serves:** NS4, NS6. **Increment 1.**\n**Done-when:** dual-axis (value-if-true Ã— groundedness) scoring; tiered honest labels (only REFUTED drops;\nsingle-family ceiling PROMISING); honest synthesis; B1 + B6 + B8 pass and their negatives FAIL; `node --test` green.\n- **Given** any divergent/brainstorm \"ideate\"-class finding, **When** B1 runs, **Then** it FAILS (ideation is\n  Jumper's).\n- **Given** a per-finding `degraded:true` with top-level `degraded:false`, **When** B6 runs, **Then** it FAILS.\n- **Given** a leg absent from `risk_labels`, OR a risk_label whose rung exceeds its leg's envelope rung,\n  **When** B8 runs, **Then** it FAILS.\n\n## Wave 7 â€” Increment-1 integration + PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation + journaling = GANDALF v1 SHIP\n**Serves:** NS1â€“NS4, NS6 (the committed shippable skill). **Increment 1 â€” COMMITTED SHIP MILESTONE.**\n**Done-when:** `node --test test/*.test.mjs` exits 0 with ALL Increment-1 canaries (B1,B3,B5,B6,B8,B9,\nB-honesty,B-ceiling) + their discriminating negatives + the meta-isolation test; B2â€²/B7â€² are stamped\nBLOCKED-this-cycle and a canary asserts they are non-gating; `NORTH-STAR.md` + `journal/` + `LESSONS.md`\nscaffolding present (canary set = the test suite; anti-drift sleep gate documented).\n- **Given** the LLM/cross-family judge endpoint is made UNREACHABLE, **When** the gate runs, **Then**\n  `node --test` still exits 0 on a conformant fixture (oracle/judge provably non-gating â€” PRINCIPLE-D).\n- **Given** the WITHOUT-ledger ship-state, **When** v1 is assessed, **Then** the anti-laundering law runs as\n  the honor-system checklist and a canary asserts B2â€²/B7â€² stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle + non-gating.\n\n## Wave 8 â€” Elevation-oracle harness + tooling + power-calc CODE (deterministic)\n**Serves:** NS5 (the instrument; the RULING is H1/H2). **Increment 3-code â€” AUTONOMOUS project-DONE.**\n**Done-when:** the `elevations.jsonl` fixture-construction TOOLING + the paired A/B harness (cross-family judge\nADAPTER, position-swap-with-agreement, length-control, answer-key scorer, CAT secondary, per-pillar baselines)\n+ the power-calc CODE are built with DETERMINISTIC unit tests green in `node --test`. NO feasibility verdict,\nNO ICC, NO advisory ruling is in this done-when â€” those are H1/H2.\n- **Given** synthetic fixtures with known answer keys, **When** the harness scorer +