{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01UvBwX91inFbrMuVx7aYwat","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Gandalf (full deep-think advisor) â€” Planning Trio Session Summary\n\n**Grounded bullet claims, traceable to the two Crucible-advisor member docs (`MASTER-PLAN.md`, `IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md`, both v2 post Shark-Tank R1).**\n\n### What the session produced\n- A **two-stage Crucible output** for \"Gandalf,\" a full deep-think advisor skill: Stage-1 Master Plan and Stage-2 Implementation Plan (Foreman handoff), each revised to **v2 after one Shark-Tank round**.\n- The build is anchored to a **LOCKED North Star** (verbatim user text, 2026-06-20): Gandalf, given any artifact/effort, (1) **diagnoses** type-appropriately and consequence-ranked, (2) **situates** it via commissioning researchPrime where warranted, and (3) **anticipates** coming problems via Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight â€” delivering elevating insight, not mere critique.\n- North Star decomposes into six inclusion-test criteria **NS1 UNDERSTAND, NS2 SITUATE, NS3 ANTICIPATE, NS4 VETTED FORWARD VALUE, NS5 ELEVATES (not merely critique), NS6 COMPOSES (does not reimplement)**.\n\n### Core v2 design decisions (what Shark-Tank R1 changed)\n- **Decoupled into three increments** so Gandalf v1 ships GREEN **without** the external Phase-0 ledger or the heavy elevation oracle.\n- A **non-additive SITUATE is a HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock event** â€” never a silent auto-descope of the locked \"commission researchPrime\" clause.\n- The elevation **oracle is staged behind a feasibility gate**, with a power-calc that SETS k (rather than asserting it).\n- Added an **ANTICIPATE additivity arm**, **B6/B8 discriminating negatives**, and a **PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test**.\n\n### PRINCIPLE-D (the deterministic done-floor)\n- Foreman's ground-truth gate is the **deterministic canary/test suite** (`node --test test/*.test.mjs`) only. **No LLM/cross-family judgment is ever inside the gate.**\n- Boundary canaries **B1â€“B9 + B-honesty + B-ceiling** each have a **discriminating negative** (a planted violation that MUST fail); canaries own **shape/rung-consistency**, while label *truth* is owned by the advisory oracle.\n- **Meta-isolation test:** with the LLM/cross-family judge endpoint made unreachable, the gate still exits 0 on a conformant fixture â€” proving advisory-isolation rather than asserting it.\n\n### Three decoupled increments (architecture)\n- **Increment 1 â€” Gandalf v1** (the committed, independently-shippable skill; serves NS1â€“NS4, NS6): full advisor on the existing trio `agent()` seam, anti-laundering law as an **honor-system checklist**, with **B2â€²/B7â€² stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle** (non-gating). Increment-1 GREEN does **not** depend on the ledger or the oracle.\n- **Increment 2 â€” machine-checked anti-laundering** (hardens NS4): unblocks **when the external Phase-0 commission-id ledger lands** (owned outside this cycle, named owner + version handle), flipping B2â€²/B7â€² + a forgery fixture from BLOCKED to a passing gate.\n- **Increment 3 â€” elevation-efficacy proof** (the NS5 claim): the measurable-elevation oracle, gated by **GATE-0.5a feasibility (FIRST)** then **GATE-0.5b A/B**, with **per-pillar additivity** â€” SITUATE measured against an **abstraction-equipped direct-researchPrime** baseline, ANTICIPATE against **diagnose-core + generic-premortem**.\n\n### Stage-2 wave decomposition (autonomous, deterministic-gated)\n- **Wave 1** schema + canary harness + frozen constants â†’ **W2** diagnose seam (NS1) â†’ **W3** SITUATE compose (NS2) â†’ **W4** refutation discipline (NS4) â†’ **W5** ANTICIPATE (NS3) â†’ **W6** score/label/synthesis â†’ **W7 = Gandalf v1 SHIP** (committed milestone) â†’ **W8** elevation-oracle harness CODE (autonomous project-DONE).\n- **Terminal semantics:** Foreman's autonomous project-DONE = **Wave 8 GREEN**; the committed shippable milestone is **Wave 7**. No Fore